like:
The positive points:

- Easily assemble reports and dashboards;

- Easy to share links for reports and dashboards;

- Easy to connect your platforms;

- Customer support is fast;

dislike:
Removed month to month comparison for some metrics, this choice should be up to the user;

Should have some general monitor for renewing integrations, what I mean with that is if has access with one of your platforms should check all the others and already renew everything at once, I know this is possible for Meta (Facebook and Instagram), because it is possible to do it on another tool called Sprout.

Also, should implement Engagement Rate vs Impressions, as it is a more familiar metric for digital marketing as a whole, following the example of CTR, which uses impressions instead of reach.
